                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "5 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The cafe has a nice, cosy ambience with warm lighting, and it’s run by a single person (probably the owner). I tried their iced lemon coffee and it was pretty good — the lemon flavour was distinct but didn’t overpower the coffee, making it very refreshing.\n\nThe only minor downside was that the owner came across as a bit serious, so the place didn’t feel as welcoming as it could have been. Other than that, no complaints.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
